@startuml
title ATM Control - Validate PIN and Withdraw Funds

[*] --> Idle

state Idle
state "Waiting for PIN" as WaitingForPIN
state "Validating PIN" as ValidatingPIN
state "Withdrawal Options" as WithdrawalOptions
state Confiscating
state Ejecting
state "Waiting for Amount" as WaitingForAmount
state "Processing Transaction" as ProcessingTransaction
state "Dispensing Cash" as DispensingCash
state "Printing Receipt" as PrintingReceipt
state "Returning Card" as ReturningCard
state "Out of Cash" as OutOfCash
state "Resetting" as Resetting

Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted / Get PIN

WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered / Validate PIN
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt

ValidatingPIN --> WithdrawalOptions : Correct PIN / Show Options
WithdrawalOptions --> WaitingForAmount : User Chooses Amount / Get Amount
WaitingForAmount --> ProcessingTransaction : Valid Amount / Check Balance & Approve
ProcessingTransaction --> DispensingCash : Approved / Dispense Cash
ProcessingTransaction --> ReturningCard : Rejected / Cancel Transaction & Return Card
ProcessingTransaction --> OutOfCash : No Cash / Stop Operation & Return Card
DispensingCash --> PrintingReceipt : Cash Dispensed / Print Receipt
PrintingReceipt --> ReturningCard : Receipt Printed / Return Card
Resetting --> Idle : Completed Session / Reset ATM
@enduml
